      "description": "Neutral state badge with an icon and a readable label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-state\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/></svg>Pending</span>",
